WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.513
Let’s walk through Received Proposals.

00:00:02.513 --> 00:00:05.250
Confirm that the proposal was forwarded to this team,

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:08.838
then read its terms and recipient-specific history in full.

00:00:08.838 --> 00:00:11.875
Interpret the current recipient state from the thread rather than

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:14.150
from proposal visibility alone.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.300
On this slide, inspect proposals forwarded to this team

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.988
and their recipient state.

00:00:18.988 --> 00:00:23.038
In practice, read the full recipient-specific thread before interpreting

00:00:23.038 --> 00:00:24.650
a proposal outcome.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:27.450
When you are ready, use Open Received Proposals to

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.163
move to the live surface.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.335
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:32.335 --> 00:00:32.510
.
